margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:27.35pt;text-indent:-27.35pt;line-height:normal">LaFave, Wayne&nbsp;R., et al.&nbsp;<i>Criminal Procedure</i>, 5th ed. St.&nbsp;Paul, Minn.: West, 2009.</p>
 <p class="SCCNormalDoubleSpacing" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;
margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:27.35pt;text-indent:-27.35pt;line-height:normal">Lamer, Antonio. “The Role of Judges”, address to the Empire Club of Canada, 1995 (online: http://speeches.empireclub.org/61076/data?n=1).</p>
 <p class="SCCNormalDoubleSpacing" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;
